<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 270-4 IN 50 OVERS V INDIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 270-4 IN 50 OVERS V INDIA.</headline>
<dateline>BLOEMFONTEIN, South Africa 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa scored 270-4 in their 50 overs against India in the day-night triangular tournament match at Springbok Park on Thursday.</p>
</text>
